{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（29日）上午9時42分，警方接獲報案，指何文田自由道4號一個建築地盤內，一輛挖泥機懷疑翻側，造成2人受傷。救援人員接報趕至，證實一名工人已當場不治，另一名男工人受傷。現場消息指，事發時挖泥機正在吊運鐵通，期間突然翻側，鐵通墮下並擊中男工人。警方及勞工處正就事故成因展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148207797742080000063748.jpeg/EmxLuDPxfyA6UfA9gnBFB1mr5SQcxy31I9Ei3iPRIt4\"/><figcaption>傷者送院。</figcaption></figure><p>勞工處現正調查今日（29日）上午在何文田發生的一宗致命工作意外，意外中一名男子死亡。處方接報後已即時派員到現場，現正就意外原因展開調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"鐵通染有大量血漬。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148212175207141376786304.jpeg/pQxfhI2WO6Ddm0MsF6oHzMaRv90uYaS58ELiBNVC4gQ\"/><figcaption>鐵通染有大量血漬。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖泥機翻側。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148209869384323072274910.jpeg/XI33VJWLmuM-maGzgb_IZfLH1huWuRtuAadaaCSnWmg\"/><figcaption>挖泥機翻側。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148212413179367424516240.jpeg/GvuNmN_HrTzdW6exzxzQYKmh6vjWF_qJ4jloF8c5aBc\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖泥機翻側。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148210919109562368649507.jpeg/d26g4Ki0U51RpcN1Prze3-CmyNLlhk35_gq8hdsKvIU\"/><figcaption>挖泥機翻側。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鐵通散落在旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148210922028929024137859.jpeg/VlcrpvnYP1mKb6nUDBj2nZiUR3ZBwzndS7PeIm6z3iI\"/><figcaption>鐵通散落在旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名男工人登上救護車接受檢查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148213362006429696178926.jpeg/4GR1s2tRktutNGcGw5rOEGWt24MteAL39oKy0dOCstE\"/><figcaption>一名男工人登上救護車接受檢查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148209340033798144701328.jpeg/524p0M0zHYaAzd_Lao4WYhElJCWhyx6maokim0-JIps\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148209342890250240345972.jpeg/bQG6xFA7qnTG3RAxR5RQYR5_og48RUnvvmEkIJthJCA\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148206109077540864362741.jpeg/X9ddkAA8TI1AyIO9I62Q_H4BgRsj-HxAbI2io2yNoqM\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T04:22:30.377566+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}